9:Cite this article: Jiang A, Ma X, Li S, Wang L, Yang B, Wang S, Li M, Dong G (2024). Ageatypical brain functional networks in autism spectrum disorder: a normative modeling approach. Psychological Medicine 54 , 2042 -2053. https://doi.org/10.1017/ S0033291724000138
