5:Data preprocessing was performed using DPABI V5.1 (Dpabi.org) and SPM12 (SPM12.ucl). The preprocessing steps included 1) discarding the first 10 time points; 2) slice-timing correction; 3) head-motion correction; 4) spatial normalization to the unified segmented anatomical image using forward deformation fields and resampling to 3×3×3 mm3; 5) spatial smoothing with a 3D isotropic Gaussian kernel with a full width at half maximum of 6 mm; 6) linear trend removal; 7) nuisance covariate regression, including head-motion covariates using the Friston 24-parameter model as well as signals from white matter and cerebrospinal fluid; and 8) bandpass filtering of the data with a frequency range of 0.01-0.08 Hz.

